{"name": "Blasterbug: Last Bug Standing!", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Blasterbug: Last Bug Standing!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw out <strong>explosive</strong> <strong>Pome-grenades</strong> and <strong>punch out</strong> your opponents to become the <strong>ultimate bug</strong>! Be careful not to get caught in the blast as you navigate <strong>evolving arenas</strong>, or you might end up as just another splatter on the arcade wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/372e9c81133d42ff2089c0c00465a64c.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/d7ea3b6c3fb43150d7a1b6da76200c79.poster.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/d7ea3b6c3fb43150d7a1b6da76200c79.webm?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/d7ea3b6c3fb43150d7a1b6da76200c79.mp4?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>15 colorful ant-stoppable bugs</strong> with <strong>dedicated special moves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly your way out of deadly situations with the\u2026 <strong>Fly</strong>, trap your enemies with your web as the sticky <strong>Spider</strong> or roll a destructive flaming dung ball with <strong>R. Beelte</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each bug has a very <strong>particular set of skills</strong> and mastering them can be a game-changer. <i>Which one will worm up your heart?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/84d450cc321dca1db3b1fe5146dd1fdc.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/5add7aa741162493abbd68f623e3ec31.poster.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/5add7aa741162493abbd68f623e3ec31.webm?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/5add7aa741162493abbd68f623e3ec31.mp4?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beetle your way into <strong>15 playable areas</strong>, each bringing their own <strong>gameplay twist</strong>. <br/>Escape the dangerous hazards of the <strong>Temple</strong>, trap your opponents on the fast lane in <strong>Bugville</strong>, avoid getting hit by spoons in the <strong>Kitchen</strong>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get spotless wins by using <strong>each environment</strong> to your <strong>advantage</strong> and creating <strong>buzzing chaos</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/52aa73304a2e0492a66821f7521d0866.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/bebdb2ccaaf5eea5a7685f50ed7ecdcf.poster.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/bebdb2ccaaf5eea5a7685f50ed7ecdcf.webm?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/bebdb2ccaaf5eea5a7685f50ed7ecdcf.mp4?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 fantas-tick <strong>game modes</strong> are available: last-bug standing <strong>Death Battle</strong>, richest-bug-wins <strong>Coin Battle</strong>, hold on to your hat <strong>Crown Battle</strong>, splatter-spreading <strong>Paint Battle</strong> and the ultimate mix it up <strong>Party Battle</strong> combining all of them together with random modifiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/f86f0bfcd6c217c4b3088cb8d2dee1c3.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/ceb47fe62373e1b2a9a8131c0e270e9e.poster.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/ceb47fe62373e1b2a9a8131c0e270e9e.webm?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/ceb47fe62373e1b2a9a8131c0e270e9e.mp4?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Blasterbug: Last Bug Standing!</i>  is designed for <strong>immediate quick-fire fun</strong> for <strong>up to</strong> <strong>8 players locally</strong>.<br/>Perfect for tussling with friends, loved ones and co-workers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your hive-mates and bzz, ziip and tsizz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"342\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/89575048b65ea1b88e57c49067ba452d.poster.avif?t=1787652914\" width=\"540\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069340/extras/89575048b65ea1b88e57c49067ba452d.webm?t=1787652914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Bzz 